{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Plangman, you take on the role of\u00a0a space pilot imprisoned in a dungeon of forgotten memories. Guess words to reconstruct your past, and use what you learn to rescue the girl you love and defeat the wizard who holds you both prisoner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's soundtrack was inspired by the great cinematic synth pioneers of the '70s and '80s, such as Vangelis,\u00a0Giorgio Moroder, Jean-Michel Jarre, and Harold Faltermeyer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Note: if you browse the local files, you may discover something else included as well!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3567210?t=1742256986","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3567210?t=1742256986","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567210/c10c1086929ae4b70be8d566b2cbbae92cdc9eaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742256986","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567210/c10c1086929ae4b70be8d566b2cbbae92cdc9eaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742256986","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Plangman, you take on the role of\u00a0a space pilot imprisoned in a dungeon of forgotten memories. Guess words to reconstruct your past, and use what you learn to rescue the girl you love and defeat the wizard who holds you both prisoner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's soundtrack was inspired by the great cinematic synth pioneers of the '70s and '80s, such as Vangelis,\u00a0Giorgio Moroder, Jean-Michel Jarre, and Harold Faltermeyer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Note: if you browse the local files, you may discover somethin